    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31565" root="غذو" body-key="g">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغتذى</span></b>  <i>He was,</i> or <i>became, fed,</i> or <i>nourished;</i>
(S, Msb, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تغذّى</span></b> . (Msb, K.) You
say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغتذى بِهِ</span> <i>He was,</i> or <i>became, fed,</i> or <i>nourished, with it;</i> (S, Msb;) namely, food, and
beverage, (S,) or milk. (Msb.)

